  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 450 F. Line a large rimmed sheet pan with parchment.",
    "Combine the rice and water in a medium pot with a lid. Bring to a boil, cover, and reduce to low. Cook 15 to 18 minutes until the water is absorbed.",
    "In a large bowl, stir the olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, cumin, paprika, coriander, cinnamon, turmeric, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the chicken, onion, and bell peppers to the bowl. Toss until everything is coated.",
    "Spread the mixture in a single layer on the sheet pan. Leave a little space between the pieces.",
    "Roast 18 to 20 minutes, stirring once halfway, until the chicken reaches 165 F and the edges of the onion and peppers are browned.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork. Divide it among four plates.",
    "Top the rice with the chicken and vegetables and scatter the cucumber on the side. Store leftovers in separate containers so the cucumber stays crisp."
  ],
